                    <p class="font-playfair italic text-lg sm:text-2xl text-deepMaroon leading-relaxed">
                        “Two souls with but a single thought, two hearts that beat as one. Together with our families, we joyfully invite you to grace our sacred union with your presence, love, and blessings.”
