                                Haldi &amp; Mehendi
                            </h3>
                            <p class="font-playfair font-semibold text-sm text-royalMaroon mt-1">
                                13th December • 10:30 AM
                            </p>
                            <p class="font-garamond text-base text-deepMaroon/85 mt-2">
                                A vibrant morning filled with turmeric blessings, henna artistry, folk songs, and floral showers.
                            </p>
                        </div>
