                                13th December • 7:00 PM
                            </p>
                            <p class="font-garamond text-base text-deepMaroon/85 mt-2">
                                An unforgettable night of music, dance performances, royal feast, and family celebrations.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Event 3: Wedding Ceremony -->
                <div class="bg-royalCream border-2 border-royalGold/50 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:border-royalGold transition-all relative overflow-hidden group">
                    <div class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-royalGold/15 group-hover:scale-125 transition-transform"></div>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-royalGold/20 border border-royalGold/50 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">
                            🔥
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <span class="font-cinzel text-xs font-bold tracking-wider text-darkGold uppercase">
                                Sacred Union
                            </span>
                            <h3 class="font-cinzel text-xl font-bold text-deepMaroon">
                                Shubh Vivah (Wedding)
                            </h3>
                            <p class="font-playfair font-semibold text-sm text-royalMaroon mt-1">
                                14th December • 7:30 PM
                            </p>
                            <p class="font-garamond text-base text-deepMaroon/85 mt-2">
                                Grand Baraat welcome followed by Varmala and sacred Vedic Pheras under the mandap.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Event 4: Reception -->
